  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 4324225024
    m_Localized: 'A close-range that gets close to its target and blasts them with
      a high-voltage electric shock. Fortunately, its batteries can''t hold the charge
      for long; they need time to recharge.

      Durable'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6765309952
    m_Localized: A close-range bot that moves closer to a target and detonates itself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8979902464
    m_Localized: A long-range bot that approaches a target at medium range and begins
      firing at them. If you get too close, it will attempt to fly away. It requires
      charging to fire, so it can only fire while standing still.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
